[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22279.03, "timestamp": "06:11:19", "text": "呃，好吧，我当时弄出了点动静。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22280.39, "timestamp": "06:11:20", "text": "调整那东西，还有这些小东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22282.948, "timestamp": "06:11:22", "text": "一群小动物朝我扑过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22287.19, "timestamp": "06:11:27", "text": "来吧，我的朋友。帮帮我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22315.75, "timestamp": "06:11:55", "text": "不错。例如，对于体型较大的动物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22318.23, "timestamp": "06:11:58", "text": "还有那些肮脏之徒，他们速度很快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22319.35, "timestamp": "06:11:59", "text": "主，"}]